<metadata><name>Day 70 - Boundary Bluffs, Hart's Tongue</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.884588" lon="-81.107644"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Parking on east side of Pit Rd just before the bend</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.895089" lon="-81.109019"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn left onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.) There is trailhead parking here (Cape Croker Indian Park: There are several parking locations within the campground).</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.896481" lon="-81.112567"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Boundary Bluffs Side Trail, heading south-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.894966" lon="-81.115009"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Hart's Tongue Side Trail, heading north-west. (the blue-blazed Boundary Bluffs Side Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.904031" lon="-81.131620"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Turnaround point. The side trail meets the white-blazed main Bruce Trail here. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
